---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <BaseHead
    title="Get in touch"
    description="Contact Our Malta"
  />
</head>

<body>
  <Header />

  <main>

    <h1>Get in touch</h1>

    <p><strong>Pause for a moment...</strong></p>

    <p>
      Imagine something uniquely Maltese. What comes to mind?
    </p>

    <p>
      What experience, place, skill, or tradition deserves to be shared?
    </p>

    <p>
      Your perspective could inspire the next great experience in Malta.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>We're listening.</strong> Share your idea, ask a question, or simply start a conversation.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h2>What is this about?</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>💡 Suggestions &amp; Ideas</li>
      <li>❓ Questions</li>
      <li>🤝 General Contact</li>
    </ul>

    <p><em>Contact form coming next…</em></p>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</body>
</html>
